# Manual exploration (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client).
# Select the "local" environment from http-client.env.json. Collections are added per feature.

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/health/live

### Readiness (Postgres, Redis)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/health/ready

### Unknown route → 404 problem+json
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json
X-Request-Id: manual-test-0001

### OpenAPI document (non-production)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs/openapi.json
